@startuml
title Target data flow after data trust corrections
top to bottom direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
component "1  Select collection target\nOperator or future bounded scheduler\nRoute / departure / passengers / currency" as Target #F5F5F5
component "2  Request source data\nServer-side provider adapter\nAPI credentials remain on the server" as Fetch #F5F5F5
component "3  Validate response and identity\nCheck route / date / currency / amount\nUnknown metadata remains unknown" as Validate #F5F5F5
component "No valid quote\nRecord run outcome\nDo not write a price\nNo invented values" as Outcomes #F5F5F5
database "4  Persist accepted observations\nSource / timestamps / cache or demo status\nCommit accepted observations first" as Store #F5F5F5
component "5  Read a comparable history\nAPI and analytics by route / departure\nReturn timestamps and data kind" as Read #F5F5F5
component "Future delivery\nCheck real observation\nAttempt push\nRecord outcome" as Delivery #F5F5F5
component "6  Flutter presentation\nShow history / assessment / timestamps\nDisplay delivery status honestly" as Client #F5F5F5
Target ..> Fetch : Bounded work item
Fetch ..> Validate : Response or failure
Validate ..> Outcomes : Not accepted
Validate ..> Store : Accepted quote
Store ..> Read : Stored history
Read ..> Client : HTTP JSON
Store ..> Delivery : After commit
Delivery ..> Client : Device notification
legend bottom
Proposed behavior | Scheduler, outcome records and push delivery are not implemented
endlegend
@enduml
